OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FTeletext Compliance      
OL,3,   EUltimateD]GLevel 1.5                
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,BCompliance                             
OL,6,FTeletextC64EUltimateGis 100% teletext  
OL,7, compliant by using proper teletext     
OL,8, character sets including the special   
OL,9, graphic (mosaic) characters and support
OL,10, for the most common diacrits / accent  
OL,11, marks.                                 
OL,13, It runs inChires bitmap modeGto support
OL,14, all the required foreground/background 
OL,15, colour combinations.                   
OL,17, To make the look & feel even more      
OL,18, authentic, it can be used with a super 
OL,19, brightARBGDBGpalette; so no washed out 
OL,20, default C64 colours (C64 Ultimate /    
OL,21, Ultimate 64 only).                     
OL,23,D]F302G<<                >>F304 B]D1/3  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
