OL,0,          BTXT64  GSat 28.11.26 02:05:49
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FTeletext Compliance      
OL,3,   EUltimateD]GLevel 1.5                
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5, It uses the same internet feed as the  
OL,6, mobile apps or websites. To make it    
OL,7, feel even more like on TV, the header  
OL,8, row is modified to show the actual date
OL,9, with a page number top left.           
OL,11, Entering page numbers works like as on 
OL,12, a remote. Just type 3 digits and the   
OL,13, requested page will be fetched, if     
OL,14, available. Browse through subpages with
OL,15, theF,G andF.Gkeys and theFHOMEGkey     
OL,16, brings you to your favourite page.     
OL,18,BFastext                                
OL,19, It also supports fastext, those four   
OL,20, colored words you see at the bottom    
OL,21, row. These are mapped to the C64       
OL,22, functions keysAf1,Bf3,Cf5GandFf7.      
OL,23,D]F302G<<                >>F304 B]D2/3  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
